1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,714
What do you do on your turn?

2
00:00:02,034 --> 00:00:03,250
You take tiles.

3
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:04,530
Here's how.

4
00:00:06,283 --> 00:00:10,166
At the start of a round, the starting player puts the marker in the centre.

5
00:00:11,266 --> 00:00:13,549
Then the starting player takes the first turn.

6
00:00:13,869 --> 00:00:15,127
Here, that's Ana.

7
00:00:16,233 --> 00:00:17,683
Turns go clockwise.

8
00:00:18,003 --> 00:00:21,203
Clockwise means the next player is the one on your left.

9
00:00:21,523 --> 00:00:23,614
With two players, they simply swap.

10
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:26,823
On your turn, you must take tiles.

11
00:00:27,143 --> 00:00:28,551
You have two choices.

12
00:00:29,666 --> 00:00:31,885
Choice one: pick a factory display.

13
00:00:32,205 --> 00:00:33,826
Then pick one colour on it.

14
00:00:36,149 --> 00:00:37,963
Ana takes both blue tiles.

15
00:00:38,283 --> 00:00:40,651
You always take every tile of that colour.

16
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:46,810
The other two tiles on that display slide into the centre of the table.

17
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:48,943
Now that display is empty.

18
00:00:50,066 --> 00:00:52,392
You can't take only some tiles of a colour.

19
00:00:52,712 --> 00:00:54,440
And you can't take two colours.

20
00:00:56,783 --> 00:00:58,212
Now it's Ben's turn.

21
00:00:58,532 --> 00:01:01,199
He takes all three red tiles from a display.

22
00:01:03,050 --> 00:01:05,140
The white one slides into the centre.

23
00:01:05,966 --> 00:01:09,209
Choice two: take one colour from the centre of the table.

24
00:01:11,083 --> 00:01:13,472
Ana takes the yellow tile from the centre.

25
00:01:13,792 --> 00:01:15,371
The other tiles stay there.

26
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:20,130
She is the first to take from the centre this round.

27
00:01:20,450 --> 00:01:22,946
So she also takes the starting player marker.

28
00:01:24,066 --> 00:01:25,986
It goes at the bottom of her board.

29
00:01:26,306 --> 00:01:27,778
It costs her one point.

30
00:01:28,098 --> 00:01:30,189
But she will go first next round.

31
00:01:32,050 --> 00:01:34,290
Later, Ben takes from the centre too.

32
00:01:34,610 --> 00:01:37,831
The marker is already gone, so he takes only tiles.

33
00:01:38,933 --> 00:01:43,434
Players keep taking turns, until every display and the centre are empty.

34
00:01:44,566 --> 00:01:45,462
Remember.

35
00:01:45,782 --> 00:01:47,681
Take all the tiles of one colour.

36
00:01:48,001 --> 00:01:51,009
From a factory display, the rest go to the centre.

37
00:01:51,329 --> 00:01:55,020
The first player to take from the centre also takes the marker.

38
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:56,854
Next: pattern lines.
